## Componentes que valem estudar

- 21st — iPhone 16 Pro: https://21st.dev/%40designali-in/components/iphone-16-pro
- 21st — Glass Real-time Chart: https://21st.dev/%40moazamtrade/components/glass-real-time-crypto-chart
- 21st — Area Chart Analytics Card: https://21st.dev/%40ahmedmayara/components/area-chart-analytics-card
- 21st — Line Charts 5: https://21st.dev/community/components/reui/line-charts-5/default
- 21st — 3D Wrapper: https://21st.dev/community/components/badtzx0/3d-wrapper
- 21st — Stats Card: https://21st.dev/%40kavikatiyar/components/stats-card-1

No React Bits, pesquisar pelos componentes `Count Up`, `Animated Content`, `Glass Surface`, `Fluid Glass`, `Reflective Card`, `Spotlight Card`, `Tilted Card` e `Electric Border`.

